# No Co-authored-by

Never add `Co-authored-by` (or `Signed-off-by` for Cursor) to a commit message, proposed `git commit` command, or commit-template text. That includes `Cursor`, `Cursor Agent`, and any other AI/tool identity.

Write only the subject (and body if needed). Do not append trailers after a blank line.
